==Strategy==
A rather hard stage due to Head Rococo having 255,000 HP even at a low magnification. Their damage is 8,500, so they can deal a decent amount of damage to your units. Hard hitting units that outrange them like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can help a lot.

